{"content_hash": "755d83a5fe0b7422", "version_id": 1063, "article_id": 109, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Cozy farming sim Green New Life launches on Steam December 7", "title_zh": "温馨种田模拟游戏《绿色新生活》12月7日登陆Steam", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/222792", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1789370902773-b8dcdcf4b4ca?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Mnx8Y2FsbSUyMGdhbWUlMjBncmVlbnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk1NjY0NTcyfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by panpan ma on Unsplash", "author": "panpan ma", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@mymphoebe?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-relaxing-in-mengyang-park-O8VETz13QlA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(180, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(218, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "dd7cc7a7ba8d"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-26", "word_count": 205, "reading_minutes": 1.0, "lead": "A small studio has made a gentle game about healing the natural world. Players plant seeds, meet forest spirits, and bring dry land back to life. The demo already has very good reviews on Steam.", "lead_zh": "一家小型工作室制作了一款关于治愈自然世界的温和游戏。玩家播下种子，遇见森林精灵，让干枯的土地重获生机。试玩版在Steam上已经获得非常好的评价。", "preview": "Publisher Gamirror Games said that Green New Life will arrive on Steam on December 7. The cozy planting sim comes from developer Positive Im", "preview_zh": "发行商Gamirror Games表示，《绿色新生活》将于12月7日登陆Steam。这款温馨种植模拟游戏出自开发商Positive Impact Games。在游戏中，你播下种子、遇见古老精灵，但最重要的事情很简单：你可以拥抱所有遇见的美好的人和动物。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1046, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 72.15, "size_bytes": 433872, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 233, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 73.875, "size_bytes": 444240, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 233, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/109/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 78.0, "size_bytes": 469008, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 233, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/109/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 66.7, "size_bytes": 401184, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 233, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/109/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/109/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 73.35, "size_bytes": 441072, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 233, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/109/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@23dfc2cf/content/data/versions/1063.json", "paragraphs": ["Publisher Gamirror Games said that Green New Life will arrive on Steam on December 7. The cozy planting sim comes from developer Positive Impact Games. In the game, you plant seeds and meet ancient spirits, but the most important thing is simple: you can hug all the lovely people and animals you find.", "The game is set inside a warm folk tale, and your job is to heal the world. You restore habitats and become friends with nature spirits, so that empty land turns green again. You use your hands, your heart and a little magic. Because seeds grow into tall trees, dry deserts slowly become rich oases.", "The developers built the game for casual players, so there are no timers and no pressure. You can repair the land at your own speed, although every action still helps nature recover. Adaptive music and soft natural sounds, such as wind, rain and running water, are part of the journey too.", "The demo has been available since October, and it has earned a Very Positive rating on Steam with 89% positive reviews. More than 50,000 people have also added the game to their wishlists. However, players must wait until December 7 to join the full green recovery."], "paragraphs_zh": ["发行商Gamirror Games表示，《绿色新生活》将于12月7日登陆Steam。这款温馨种植模拟游戏出自开发商Positive Impact Games。在游戏中，你播下种子、遇见古老精灵，但最重要的事情很简单：你可以拥抱所有遇见的美好的人和动物。", "游戏设定在一个温暖的民间故事里，你的任务是治愈这个世界。你恢复栖息地，与自然精灵成为朋友，让空旷的土地重新变绿。你用自己的双手、真心和一点点魔法。因为种子会长成高大的树木，干旱的沙漠慢慢变成富饶的绿洲。", "开发者是为休闲玩家打造这款游戏的，所以没有计时器，也没有压力。你可以按自己的节奏修复土地，而每一个行动仍然帮助自然恢复。自适应音乐和柔和的自然声音，比如风声、雨声和流水声，也是这段旅程的一部分。", "试玩版自10月起开放，已在Steam上获得“特别好评”，好评率为89%。还有超过5万人将这款游戏加入了愿望单。不过，玩家必须等到12月7日才能加入完整的绿色恢复之旅。"], "body": "Publisher Gamirror Games said that Green New Life will arrive on Steam on December 7. The cozy planting sim comes from developer Positive Impact Games. In the game, you plant seeds and meet ancient spirits, but the most important thing is simple: you can hug all the lovely people and animals you find.\n\nThe game is set inside a warm folk tale, and your job is to heal the world. You restore habitats and become friends with nature spirits, so that empty land turns green again. You use your hands, your heart and a little magic. Because seeds grow into tall trees, dry deserts slowly become rich oases.\n\nThe developers built the game for casual players, so there are no timers and no pressure. You can repair the land at your own speed, although every action still helps nature recover. Adaptive music and soft natural sounds, such as wind, rain and running water, are part of the journey too.\n\nThe demo has been available since October, and it has earned a Very Positive rating on Steam with 89% positive reviews. More than 50,000 people have also added the game to their wishlists. However, players must wait until December 7 to join the full green recovery.", "body_zh": "发行商Gamirror Games表示，《绿色新生活》将于12月7日登陆Steam。这款温馨种植模拟游戏出自开发商Positive Impact Games。在游戏中，你播下种子、遇见古老精灵，但最重要的事情很简单：你可以拥抱所有遇见的美好的人和动物。\n\n游戏设定在一个温暖的民间故事里，你的任务是治愈这个世界。你恢复栖息地，与自然精灵成为朋友，让空旷的土地重新变绿。你用自己的双手、真心和一点点魔法。因为种子会长成高大的树木，干旱的沙漠慢慢变成富饶的绿洲。\n\n开发者是为休闲玩家打造这款游戏的，所以没有计时器，也没有压力。你可以按自己的节奏修复土地，而每一个行动仍然帮助自然恢复。自适应音乐和柔和的自然声音，比如风声、雨声和流水声，也是这段旅程的一部分。\n\n试玩版自10月起开放，已在Steam上获得“特别好评”，好评率为89%。还有超过5万人将这款游戏加入了愿望单。不过，玩家必须等到12月7日才能加入完整的绿色恢复之旅。", "text": "Publisher Gamirror Games said that Green New Life will arrive on Steam on December 7. The cozy planting sim comes from developer Positive Impact Games. In the game, you plant seeds and meet ancient spirits, but the most important thing is simple: you can hug all the lovely people and animals you find. The game is set inside a warm folk tale, and your job is to heal the world. You restore habitats and become friends with nature spirits, so that empty land turns green again. You use your hands, your heart and a little magic. Because seeds grow into tall trees, dry deserts slowly become rich oases. The developers built the game for casual players, so there are no timers and no pressure. You can repair the land at your own speed, although every action still helps nature recover. Adaptive music and soft natural sounds, such as wind, rain and running water, are part of the journey too. The demo has been available since October, and it has earned a Very Positive rating on Steam with 89% positive reviews. More than 50,000 people have also added the game to their wishlists. However, players must wait until December 7 to join the full green recovery.", "vocab": [{"word": "cozy", "pos": "adj", "zh": "温馨的；舒适的", "note": "常形容轻松、无压力的游戏或环境", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sim", "pos": "noun", "zh": "模拟游戏", "note": "simulation 的口语缩写", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "habitat", "pos": "noun", "zh": "栖息地", "note": "动植物的自然生活环境", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "restore", "pos": "verb", "zh": "恢复；修复", "note": "常与 nature、habitat 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "oasis", "pos": "noun", "zh": "绿洲", "note": "沙漠中有水有植物的地方", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "casual", "pos": "adj", "zh": "休闲的", "note": "casual player 指休闲玩家", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "at your own pace", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "按自己的节奏", "note": "常用短语，表示不赶时间", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "wishlist", "pos": "noun", "zh": "愿望单", "note": "Steam 上收藏想买的游戏列表", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "rating", "pos": "noun", "zh": "评分；评价", "note": "常与 positive、negative 连用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "recovery", "pos": "noun", "zh": "复苏；恢复", "note": "指生态或健康的恢复", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-26T03:42:27.570696", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Publisher", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.75, "sm": 250, "em": 750, "cs": 0, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "Gamirror", "s": 0.75, "e": 1.225, "sm": 750, "em": 1225, "cs": 10, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Games", "s": 1.225, "e": 1.575, "sm": 1225, "em": 1574, "cs": 19, "ce": 24, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "said", "s": 1.575, "e": 1.762, "sm": 1575, "em": 1762, "cs": 25, "ce": 29, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "that", "s": 1.762, "e": 1.938, "sm": 1762, "em": 1937, "cs": 30, "ce": 34, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "Green", "s": 1.938, "e": 2.275, "sm": 1937, "em": 2274, "cs": 35, "ce": 40, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "New", "s": 2.275, "e": 2.45, "sm": 2275, "em": 2449, "cs": 41, "ce": 44, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "Life", "s": 2.45, "e": 2.763, "sm": 2450, "em": 2762, "cs": 45, "ce": 49, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "will", "s": 2.763, "e": 2.9, "sm": 2762, "em": 2899, "cs": 50, "ce": 54, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "arrive", "s": 2.9, "e": 3.288, "sm": 2900, "em": 3287, "cs": 55, "ce": 61, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "on", "s": 3.288, "e": 3.487, "sm": 3287,